WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.555 --> 00:00:15.417
Ben rushed outside with the others to meet the humans.

2
00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:19.741
The school bus from People Place was parked in front of the school.

3
00:00:19.761 --> 00:00:23.603
"This is going to be so scary!"

4
00:00:24.024 --> 00:00:24.804
said a werewolf.

5
00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:26.385
"I know!"

6
00:00:26.746 --> 00:00:27.806
said a fish monster.

7
00:00:27.826 --> 00:00:29.768
"I love being scared!"

8
00:00:31.024 --> 00:00:34.166
Mr. Freaky was standing on the sidewalk near the school bus.

9
00:00:35.187 --> 00:00:38.429
He turned around to warn the Monster Academy students again.

10
00:00:38.449 --> 00:00:40.911
"Remember, monsters!"

11
00:00:41.251 --> 00:00:42.112
said the principal.

12
00:00:42.132 --> 00:00:44.754
"I want you all to behave.

13
00:00:45.414 --> 00:00:48.236
No growling, fire breathing, or drooling!"

14
00:00:49.177 --> 00:00:52.479
A zombie slowly reached up and wiped the drool from his mouth.

15
00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:55.501
Ben hoped everyone would listen to Mr.

16
00:00:55.602 --> 00:00:58.824
Freaky for once, and the humans' visit would go smoothly.

17
00:01:00.244 --> 00:01:03.246
He didn't want Mayor Hubbletree to be angry with monsters.

18
00:01:04.286 --> 00:01:07.088
What if the mayor really did bulldoze Monster Academy?

19
00:01:08.509 --> 00:01:09.849
Where would Ben go to school?

20
00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:12.171
He might never see Winnie again!

21
00:01:13.611 --> 00:01:17.553
The door to the school bus opened, and Mayor Hubbletree stepped out.

22
00:01:18.794 --> 00:01:21.616
Luckily the mayor appeared to be in a good mood.

23
00:01:21.636 --> 00:01:23.657
"Good morning!"

24
00:01:24.157 --> 00:01:26.018
Mayor Hubbletree greeted the monsters.

25
00:01:26.038 --> 00:01:29.520
"It's a beautiful day for a field trip."

26
00:01:30.564 --> 00:01:31.405
He pumped Mr.

27
00:01:31.465 --> 00:01:32.806
Freaky's hand up and down.

28
00:01:32.826 --> 00:01:35.307
"Don't you think so, Mr.

29
00:01:35.367 --> 00:01:37.689
Freaky?" "Of course!"

30
00:01:38.109 --> 00:01:38.549
said Mr.

31
00:01:38.609 --> 00:01:41.331
Freaky. "Thanks for coming, Mayor Hubbletree.

32
00:01:42.231 --> 00:01:46.694
We have a wonderful day planned—all kinds of fun and exciting events."

33
00:01:48.134 --> 00:01:51.096
A thin woman holding a clipboard stepped off the bus.

34
00:01:52.337 --> 00:01:57.020
"Excuse me," she murmured as she tried to slip by a large blob to greet Mr.

35
00:01:57.060 --> 00:02:02.426
Freaky. Mayor Hubbletree introduced them.

36
00:02:02.446 --> 00:02:05.048
"Mr. Freaky, this is Ms.

37
00:02:05.108 --> 00:02:07.650
Prim, the principal of People Place Middle School."

38
00:02:07.670 --> 00:02:09.951
"Oh, hello!"

39
00:02:10.452 --> 00:02:10.892
said Mr.

40
00:02:10.952 --> 00:02:13.574
Freaky. He shook the woman's hand.

41
00:02:13.594 --> 00:02:16.517
"I'm um Ms.

42
00:02:16.597 --> 00:02:17.678
Prim cleared her throat.

43
00:02:17.698 --> 00:02:20.060
"I'm very pleased to meet you."

44
00:02:21.260 --> 00:02:23.762
A human boy peeked out the door of the bus next.

45
00:02:24.683 --> 00:02:25.964
He looked nervous too.

46
00:02:27.025 --> 00:02:30.428
After a moment he stepped out, and then more students followed.

47
00:02:35.488 --> 00:02:38.871
The students' eyes all went wide at the sight of the monsters.

48
00:02:39.971 --> 00:02:42.813
Near Ben, a few monsters started whispering.

49
00:02:42.833 --> 00:02:46.876
"People are so creepy," said a goblin.

50
00:02:46.896 --> 00:02:50.279
"Yeah," agreed a purple monster.

51
00:02:50.299 --> 00:02:52.420
"They look so weird!"

52
00:02:53.821 --> 00:02:56.323
For a few moments, nobody said anything.

53
00:02:58.485 --> 00:03:00.306
Mayor Hubbletree looked at his watch.

54
00:03:01.166 --> 00:03:03.028
Mr. Freaky coughed nervously.

55
00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:06.921
Then Jen called out, "Hi, Dave!"

56
00:03:08.241 --> 00:03:10.842
Dave stepped out from the crowd of people and grinned.

57
00:03:10.862 --> 00:03:12.222
"Hi, Jen!"

58
00:03:13.363 --> 00:03:16.683
All at once the Monster Academy cheerleaders began to cheer.

59
00:03:18.564 --> 00:03:20.384
Welcome, welcome to our school!

60
00:03:22.245 --> 00:03:24.026
We know you'll find it really cool!

61
00:03:25.966 --> 00:03:31.448
We hope before the day is done, You'll be friends with everyone!

62
00:03:31.648 --> 00:03:35.989
Yay! The cheerleaders shook their pom-poms.

63
00:03:39.751 --> 00:03:43.412
Several of them formed a pyramid, while others did flips in the air.

64
00:03:44.793 --> 00:03:48.975
The spectacle ended with an octopus monster doing an eight-armed split.

65
00:03:51.396 --> 00:03:54.857
Everyone—monsters and humans—whistled and cheered.

66
00:03:55.817 --> 00:03:57.418
Mr. Freaky was beaming.

67
00:03:59.379 --> 00:04:01.280
Mayor Hubbletree clapped him on the back.

68
00:04:01.972 --> 00:04:04.574
"This is very impressive stuff, Freaky!"

69
00:04:05.834 --> 00:04:08.336
Suddenly—zoom! "Whoa!"

70
00:04:08.696 --> 00:04:10.657
Ben glanced eagerly toward the sky.

71
00:04:11.558 --> 00:04:14.199
It was time for Winnie's performance in the flyover.

72
00:04:14.219 --> 00:04:20.243
The broom flying squad shot through the air, dropping black and orange confetti.

73
00:04:25.526 --> 00:04:29.448
They did a wide loop, and then swooped back down, zigzagging.

74
00:04:31.516 --> 00:04:35.677
"Whoa!" cried the students, human and monster.

75
00:04:35.697 --> 00:04:41.459
"Awesome!" The broom fliers were now weaving in and out of one another.

76
00:04:41.479 --> 00:04:43.839
"How do they do that?"

77
00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:45.480
asked a human boy.

78
00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:48.061
"They're going to crash!"

79
00:04:48.381 --> 00:04:49.361
cried a human girl.

80
00:04:50.241 --> 00:04:51.882
But the fliers didn't crash.

81
00:04:52.282 --> 00:04:59.664
Instead they sailed high above the school, flying up and down, faster and faster, doing loops and figure

82
00:04:59.704 --> 00:05:07.791
eights. "These fliers are amazing, Freaky," said Mayor Hubbletree.

83
00:05:07.811 --> 00:05:10.253
"Are you sure this is safe?"

84
00:05:10.713 --> 00:05:11.194
asked Ms.

85
00:05:11.234 --> 00:05:15.216
Prim. "Oh yes," said the principal.

86
00:05:15.236 --> 00:05:17.138
"You can relax, Ms.

87
00:05:17.198 --> 00:05:21.821
Prim. Monster Academy has the best broom-flying teacher around.

88
00:05:22.922 --> 00:05:26.364
And the students in that squad are the best fliers at our school."

89
00:05:27.585 --> 00:05:31.368
While the rest of the crowd cheered and clapped, Ben watched silently.

90
00:05:32.332 --> 00:05:35.354
The fliers were amazing, but something was wrong.

91
00:05:36.535 --> 00:05:37.616
Winnie wasn't with them.

92
00:05:37.636 --> 00:05:41.178
"This doesn't make sense," thought Ben.

93
00:05:41.198 --> 00:05:44.340
"Why isn't Winnie flying with the squad?"

94
00:05:45.621 --> 00:05:48.143
"This is quite a welcome, Freaky!"

95
00:05:48.603 --> 00:05:49.884
Mayor Hubbletree declared.

96
00:05:50.844 --> 00:05:52.605
Mr. Freaky flushed with delight.

97
00:05:52.626 --> 00:05:55.087
"Thank you, Mayor.

98
00:05:55.367 --> 00:05:58.529
We wanted to make sure you humans felt at home."

99
00:05:59.930 --> 00:06:02.012
The cheerleaders formed another pyramid.

100
00:06:02.572 --> 00:06:06.896
An octopus monster leaped to the top of the pyramid and then held out her arms.

101
00:06:07.797 --> 00:06:11.740
Poof! A large banner appeared in front of the octopus monster.

102
00:06:12.861 --> 00:06:18.485
Light sparkled across the surface of the banner, and then letters began magically spelling out something.

103
00:06:18.505 --> 00:06:22.989
"Oh yes, Freaky," Ben heard Mayor Hubbletree say.

104
00:06:23.009 --> 00:06:26.732
"We certainly feel welcome at Monster Academy.

105
00:06:27.633 --> 00:06:31.016
I have to admit, I was mistaken about monsters.

106
00:06:31.864 --> 00:06:35.927
I never should have—" Suddenly a gasp rose from the students.

107
00:06:37.849 --> 00:06:41.532
Written across the banner were the words: "We Eat People!"
